<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad R'dam Q1 97 net profit DFL 31.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Stad R'dam Q1 97 net profit DFL 31.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997 to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.97 vs   0.89</p>
<p>    Net profit			    31.6  vs  27.7</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.28 vs   1.06</p>
<p>    Tax				     16.0  vs  14.1</p>
<p>    Minority interests		   7.7  vs   7.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected insurance firm Stad Rotterdam Anno 1720 NV to report a net profit of 29.5 million to 33.5 million guilders over the first quarter of 1997.  </p>
<p>Premium income per sector:</p>
<p>    - Life insurance		    471.8 vs  371.3</p>
<p>    - Non-life			    510.2 vs  420.2</p>
<p>Operating profit per sector:</p>
<p>    - Life insurance		     26.0 vs   22.6</p>
<p>    - Non-life insurance		 23.8 vs   21.5</p>
<p>    - Other activities		    5.5 vs    4.9</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
